Overlay patch 0017: "iOS" section in the port's Settings sidebar
(Sync Wave 1 settings spec, adapted). Sections/knobs per the spec —
Touch Controls (Haptics, Opacity, Left-Handed, Stick Response, Customize
Layout), Display (Max Frame Rate per 0015, Performance HUD), Menu (LIVE
Menu Scale via ScaleImGui), Advanced (Remote Console :8769).
GHOSTSHIP-SPECIFIC: NO lock modes (SM64 = momentary everything, per-game
policy) — the Ship of Harkinian port Double-Tap-Z row is deliberately absent, and the
shell's Z handler is momentary-only. __IOS__-gated; oracle unchanged.
rev3 (2026-10-08): Touch Controls gains "Always Show Menu Button"
(gSohIos.MenuAlwaysVisible, D19 = SoH D-083) and, iPhone only, "Touch Camera
Sensitivity" (gSohIos.TouchLookSens, drag-look for the Manual camera, overlay
0053, D20 = SoH D-081).

